<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Page introuvable — GEI</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #07111f;
            --bg-strong: #0d1727;
            --panel: rgba(10, 18, 30, 0.82);
            --panel-border: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.18);
            --text: #e2e8f0;
            --muted: #94a3b8;
            --soft: #cbd5e1;
            --accent: #f59e0b;
            --accent-soft: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.18);
            --accent-strong: #fbbf24;
            --shadow: rgba(8, 15, 25, 0.48);
        }

        * { box-sizing: border-box; }

        html, body {
            margin: 0;
            min-height: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background:
                radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.12), transparent 25%),
                radial-gradient(circle at bottom right, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.10), transparent 30%),
                linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg) 0%, var(--bg-strong) 100%);
            color: var(--text);
        }

        body {
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            padding: 28px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .scene {
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .orb {
            position: absolute;
            border-radius: 50%;
            filter: blur(18px);
            opacity: 0.42;
            animation: drift 18s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
        }

        .orb--one {
            width: 320px;
            height: 320px;
            background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.16);
            top: 8%;
            left: 10%;
        }

        .orb--two {
            width: 380px;
            height: 380px;
            background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.12);
            right: 8%;
            bottom: 10%;
            animation-delay: 2s;
        }

        @keyframes drift {
            0% { transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale(1); }
            100% { transform: translate3d(22px, -18px, 0) scale(1.08); }
        }

        .err-shell {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: minmax(180px, 220px) minmax(0, 1fr);
            align-items: center;
            width: min(760px, 100%);
            min-height: 430px;
            padding: 28px 30px;
            border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
            border-radius: 28px;
            background: rgba(11, 18, 30, 0.72);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            box-shadow: 0 30px 90px var(--shadow);
        }

        .err-visual {
            position: relative;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            min-height: 230px;
        }

        .err-glow {
            position: absolute;
            width: 165px;
            height: 165px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.35) 0%, rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1) 38%, transparent 72%);
            filter: blur(10px);
            animation: pulse 4s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        @keyframes pulse {
            0%, 100% { transform: scale(0.96); opacity: 0.9; }
            50% { transform: scale(1.08); opacity: 1; }
        }

        .err-icon-wrap {
            position: relative;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            width: 120px;
            height: 120px;
            border-radius: 28px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.35);
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.12), rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.03));
            box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.04), 0 22px 40px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.12);
            animation: float 5s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        @keyframes float {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-8px); }
        }

        .err-icon {
            font-size: 3rem;
            color: var(--accent-strong);
            line-height: 1;
        }

        .err-badge {
            position: absolute;
            left: 50%;
            bottom: 16px;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 8px 12px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.18);
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8);
            color: var(--soft);
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.12em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .err-badge::before {
            content: "";
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--accent-strong);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.12);
        }

        .err-content {
            display: grid;
            gap: 14px;
            padding-left: 14px;
        }

        .err-label {
            color: var(--accent-strong);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.18em;
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .err-code {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 6rem);
            line-height: 0.88;
            letter-spacing: -0.08em;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.18);
            text-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.06);
        }

        h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 2.8rem);
            line-height: 1.1;
            letter-spacing: -0.05em;
            color: var(--text);
        }

        .err-sub {
            margin: 0;
            max-width: 48ch;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.98rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .err-actions {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-top: 8px;
        }

        .err-btn,
        .err-link {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 46px;
            padding: 0 18px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: transform 0.2s ease, opacity 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
        }

        .err-btn {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.18), rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.08));
            border: 1px solid rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.35);
            color: var(--accent-strong);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.10);
        }

        .err-link {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85);
            border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.16);
            color: var(--soft);
        }

        .err-btn:hover,
        .err-link:hover {
            transform: translateY(-1px);
            opacity: 0.97;
        }

        @media (max-width: 640px) {
            body {
                padding: 18px;
            }

            .err-shell {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 18px;
                min-height: auto;
                padding: 24px 20px 22px;
                border-radius: 22px;
            }

            .err-visual {
                min-height: 160px;
            }

            .err-icon-wrap {
                width: 96px;
                height: 96px;
            }

            .err-icon {
                font-size: 2.4rem;
            }

            .err-content {
                padding-left: 0;
                text-align: center;
            }

            .err-actions {
                justify-content: center;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="scene" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="orb orb--one"></div>
        <div class="orb orb--two"></div>
    </div>

    <main class="err-shell" role="alert" aria-live="polite">
        <div class="err-visual">
            <div class="err-glow"></div>
            <div class="err-icon-wrap">
                <i class="err-icon bi bi-compass-fill"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="err-badge">GEI Platform</div>
        </div>

        <div class="err-content">
            <div class="err-label">Navigation</div>
            <div class="err-code">404</div>
            <h1>Page introuvable</h1>
            <p class="err-sub">La page que vous cherchez n’existe pas, a été déplacée ou n’est plus disponible. Vérifiez l’URL ou revenez au tableau de bord pour poursuivre votre travail.</p>

            <div class="err-actions">
                <a href="/" class="err-btn"><i class="bi bi-house-door-fill"></i>&nbsp;Tableau de bord</a>
                <a href="javascript:history.back()" class="err-link"><i class="bi bi-arrow-left"></i>&nbsp;Retour</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
